Text detection and recognition parameters of sd-webui-ocr, as deployed for SegmentOCR.

det_limit_side_len 960 -> 3200, det_db_thresh 0.3 -> 0.2, det_db_box_thresh 0.6 -> 0.2,
det_db_unclip_ratio 1.5 -> 2.5, drop_score 0.5 -> 0.2, use_angle_cls False -> True.
use_angle_cls has no effect on POST /ocr/predict (the predictor is called without the angle
classifier step). The other values change which text regions are kept and therefore the OCR text.
Base: SpenserCai/sd-webui-ocr @ 5c75383ce6f0389e7d3521c5481f5bdddea8e167

